{"id":"cb23adbb0c25658e","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Rudin Keisler Reduction","display":"df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction — ZFC Filter7 Rudin Keisler Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction — ZFC Filter7 Rudin Keisler Reduction","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction — ZFC Filter7 Rudin Keisler Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V,f\\in V\\)</span> (carriers, ultrafilters, and reduction map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X),\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X),\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (relation-preimage predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S(X,\\mathcal U,Y,\\mathcal V,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(B,f,A)\\land(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S(X,\\mathcal U,Y,\\mathcal V,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(B,f,A)\\land(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=f_*(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathcal V=f_*(\\mathcal U)\\)</span>, so the displayed map witnesses that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> is a Rudin--Keisler reduct of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>; every inverse image is supplied by the canonical relation-preimage predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X),\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)$ (ultrafilter predicates, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (relation-preimage predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X),\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}rudin\\text{-}keisler\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RudinKeislerReduction}_S(X,\\mathcal U,Y,\\mathcal V,f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal V,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq Y\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(B,f,A)\\land(A\\in\\mathcal V\\leftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal U)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V=f_*(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":1718,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1924","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-rudin-keisler-reduction]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751","39c10f49239bf771"]}